      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "question",
      "start_seconds": 0.18,
      "text": "为什么工作永远做不完？"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 4.26,
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "这在互联网企业尤其明显"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 5.6,
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "他们招了那么多的人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 6.8,
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "明明东西就这么一小块"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 7.85,
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "可以招无限多的人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 8.8,
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "可以无限地加"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 10.85,
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "你招了人，开始去做了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 12.35,
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "觉得可以做完了，结果后来"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 14.1,
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 12.42,
      "text": "越做越多，人越招越多"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 16.4,
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 14.1,
      "text": "它可以无限地膨胀下去"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 19.55,
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 16.4,
      "text": "因为绝大多数的人\n都是在使用reactive"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 21.15,
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 19.55,
      "text": "就是这种反应的方式"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 23.88,
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 21.15,
      "text": "戳一下，动一下\n戳一下，动一下"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 27.6,
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 24.273,
      "text": "他动一下，\n还不是为了解决问题"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 28.9,
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 27.6,
      "text": "比如说，假设我这儿疼"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 31.3,
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 28.9,
      "text": "我应该知道是什么肌肉问题"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 33.9,
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 31.3,
      "text": "或者骨骼问题，\n导致了我这儿疼"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 36.75,
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 33.9,
      "text": "我应该把这个问题解决了，对吧"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 38.8,
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "question",
      "start_seconds": 36.75,
      "text": "你上来冰敷一下\n这个问题解决了吗？"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 39.5,
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 38.8,
      "text": "没有解决"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 40.7,
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 39.5,
      "text": "很多人工作中就是这样"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 42.1,
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 40.7,
      "text": "只是为了解决表面上的问题"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 43.88,
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 42.1,
      "text": "从来不解决深层次的问题"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 45.9,
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 43.88,
      "text": "那问题只会越做越多"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 47.6,
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 45.9,
      "text": "你的问题从来得不到解决"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 49.15,
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 47.6,
      "text": "这件事永远没有做好的那天"
